<title>SPAIN: Ferrovial sells 2 pct of BCH for 12.5 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Ferrovial sells 2 pct of BCH for 12.5 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction firm Group Ferrovial sold its two percent stake in Spanish bank BCH to institutional investors, a Ferrovial spokesman confirmed on Friday.</p>
<p>The sale brought Ferrovial revenues of some 12.5 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>The operation began several days ago with the sale of 0.3 percent of the bank and finished on Thursday with the sale of the remaining 1.7 percent stake.</p>
<p>The operation was conducted by Central Hispano Bolsa outside of bourse hours at a price of 3,810 per share.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
